// A rules probe (GDR-0092, `arena::rules_fingerprint`): the Runner and the starter against two raiders and a hunter
// at 45 m, 10 s, so guns, hits, plumes and broken parts all happen early. Its final hash changes with almost any
// change to the sim's code. Changing this file changes every fight code's fingerprint.
(
    seed: 1,
    sides: [
        (entries: [(design: Ship("halvex_runner")), (design: Ship("rim_skiff"))]),
        (entries: [(design: Ship("automaton_raider"), count: 2), (design: Ship("automaton_hunter"))]),
    ],
    start_distance: 45.0,
    time_limit: 10.0,
)
